    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35367" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνελαύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drive in</i> or <i>into,</i> c. dat., 
